 server←{which}Run port;folder;rc;msg
⍝ Start the Exercise 4 chat server on localhost
⍝ which  - [optional] 'Start' (default) or 'Solution': the folder whose code is loaded
⍝ port   - the port to listen on (the README uses 8084)
⍝ server - the Jarvis server; stop it with server.Stop
⍝          ⍬ if Setup has not been run or the folder does not exist
⍝          the Jarvis server, not started, if it could not start (e.g. the port is in use)
⍝ The code is loaded into #.Ex4: Connect, Receive, and Disconnect (called by Jarvis when a client connects,
⍝ sends a message, or disconnects), plus the supplied Now and Reply. Edit with )ED, e.g. )ED #.Ex4.Receive;
⍝ the server uses the change straight away. The server is kept in #.Ex4Server, so running Run again stops it first.
⍝ The web page is served from html/index.html.
⍝ Usage:
⍝      server←Run 8084
⍝      server←'Solution' Run 8084
 server←⍬
 :If 0=⎕NC'which'
     which←'Start'
 :EndIf
 :If 0=#.⎕NC'WorkshopRoot'
     ⎕←'Problem: run Setup first (see Exercises/README.md)'
     →0
 :EndIf
 folder←#.WorkshopRoot,'/Exercises/Ex4-WebSockets/'
 :If ~⎕NEXISTS folder,which
     ⎕←'Problem: no folder "',folder,which,'"; use ''Start'' or ''Solution'''
     →0
 :EndIf

⍝ Stop the server from an earlier Run, if it is still running.
⍝ On Linux, a second server on a port already used in the same session starts without an error, and the old one
⍝ keeps answering with the old code. On Windows the second server fails to start with "port in use". Either way, stop first.
 :If 9=⌊#.⎕NC'Ex4Server'
 :AndIf #.Ex4Server.Running
     {}#.Ex4Server.Stop
     ⎕←'Stopped the Exercise 4 server that was already running'
 :EndIf

⍝ Load the functions into a fresh #.Ex4, and set up its data
 #.⎕EX'Ex4'
 'Ex4'#.⎕NS''
 {}{2 #.Ex4.⎕FIX'file://',⍵}¨⊃0(⎕NINFO⍠1)folder,which,'/*.aplf'
 {}{2 #.Ex4.⎕FIX'file://',folder,⍵}¨'Now.aplf' 'Reply.aplf' ⍝ supplied helpers
 #.Ex4.Clients←⍬ ⍝ the names of the open connections (Connect adds, Disconnect removes)

 server←#.Jarvis.New''
 #.Ex4Server←server
 server.Port←port
 server.CodeLocation←#.Ex4
 server.EnableWebSockets←1
 server.OnWsUpgradeFn←'Connect'      ⍝ a client opened a WebSocket connection
 server.OnWsReceiveFn←'Receive'      ⍝ a client sent a message
 server.OnWsCloseFn←'Disconnect'     ⍝ a connection closed
 server.ExcludeFns←'*'               ⍝ no ordinary endpoints: this server only does WebSockets and the web page
 server.HTMLInterface←folder,'html'  ⍝ serve the web page from html/
 server.DYALOG_JARVIS_THREAD←'DEBUG' ⍝ run in the background, keep the session usable
 (rc msg)←server.Start
 :If rc≠0
     ⎕←'Problem: could not start the server: ',msg
     ⎕←'If port ',(⍕port),' is in use, try another, for example: server←Run ',⍕port+10
     →0
 :EndIf
 ⎕←'Exercise 4 (',which,') is running: open http://localhost:',(⍕port),' in your browser'
